  "heading": "S \\:(linearly.independent)::subset:/ V",
  "heading_latex": "\\htmlData{mlg-ref=5c3a7375627365743a2f}{A\\textrm{ is a subset of }B}\\textrm{ }\\left(\\textrm{linearly independent}\\right)",
